<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95720" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπᾰν-ίζω</span></b> , of things, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be rare, scarce</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλὰ ἔργα] Βασσίδαισιν οὐ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				6.31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὐλαίου σπανίζοντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					252
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ παρ᾽ ἀμφοτέροις σπανίζοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.54
				</span></i>
			, etc.; of books, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).605
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>lack, be in want of</i>, c.gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.108
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρημάτων, βίου</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.187
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				196
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ σπανίζοντες φίλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					717
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέπλων, πομπῆς, βωμοῦ</span>,
			etc., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				960
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IA</u>
				352
			</span></i> (troch.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				800
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῶν μακρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.41
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.6
				</span></i>
			, etc.; of a country, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πεύκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					5.7.1
				</span></i>
			: rarely c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίτῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dicaearch.
					1.23
				</span></i>
			 cod., cf.<i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i> fin. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>exhaust, use up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μέταλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.Byz.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					4.1
				</span></i>
			; <i>spend,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				99.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i/ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				4317.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσπανίσθη πᾶν ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Jb.</u>
					14.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			,= 
				Act.
			 (signf. <i><span class="en">
				1.2
			</span></i>), <i>to be in want of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσπανίσμεθ᾽ ἀρωγῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					1024
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρᾷς . . φίλων ὡς ἐσπανίσμεθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1055
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντων σπανιζόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.2.16
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>to be in want</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ σπανιζοίμεσθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					560
				</span></i>
			: rarely c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνῳ σπανίζονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					3.3.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
